{"schema":1,"revision":80038622,"page":{"pageid":3356729,"title":"肉莖 (蜘蛛)","displayTitle":"肉莖 (蜘蛛)","variant":"zh-tw"},"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh-Hant-TW\" dir=\"ltr\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Spider-characteristics.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Spider-characteristics.png/250px-Spider-characteristics.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"138\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/ab/Spider-characteristics.png/500px-Spider-characteristics.png?utm_source=zh.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1300\" data-file-height=\"996\" /></a><figcaption><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9C%98%E8%9B%9B\" title=\"蜘蛛\">蜘蛛</a>的解剖結構：<br /> (1) 四對<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E7%AF%80%E8%82%A2%E5%8B%95%E7%89%A9%E7%9A%84%E8%85%BF&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"節肢動物的腿（頁面不存在）\">腿</a><br />(2) <a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A0%AD%E8%83%B8%E9%83%A8\" title=\"頭胸部\">頭胸部</a><br />(3) <a href=\"/wiki/%E8%85%B9%E9%83%A8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"腹部\">腹部</a></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9C%98%E8%9B%9B\" title=\"蜘蛛\">蜘蛛</a>的<b>肉莖</b>是其<a href=\"/wiki/%E9%A0%AD%E8%83%B8%E9%83%A8\" title=\"頭胸部\">頭胸部</a>和<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%85%B9%E9%83%A8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"腹部\">腹部</a>間接連著的一條小而有彈性的肉質柱體，有助蜘蛛在吐絲欴時，無需移動其頭胸部<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-RFB2004Spiders&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-RFB2004Spiders-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>。雖然其英語名稱跟<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%85%95%E8%B6%B3%E5%8A%A8%E7%89%A9%E9%97%A8\" title=\"腕足動物門\">腕足動物門</a>的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%82%89%E8%8E%96\" title=\"肉莖\">肉莖</a>一樣，但蜘蛛的肉莖只一條肌肉，並不是一個可以把身體固定於外物的器官。事實上這條肉莖是頭胸部的最後一節，只在較為原始的<a href=\"/wiki/%E8%9B%9B%E5%BD%A2%E7%B6%B1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"蛛形綱\">蛛形綱</a>物種中保留；其餘物種（包括蠍子，只能在其胚胎中發現）均已退化或消失。\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"參考資料\"><span id=\".E5.8F.83.E8.80.83.E8.B3.87.E6.96.99\"></span>參考資料</h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%82%89%E8%8E%96_(%E8%9C%98%E8%9B%9B)&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"編輯章節：參考資料\"><span>編輯</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95320392\">.mw-parser-output .reflist{margin-bottom:0.5em;list-style-type:decimal}@media screen{.mw-parser-output .reflist{font-size:90%}}.mw-parser-output .reflist .references{font-size:100%;margin-bottom:0;list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns{margin-top:0.3em}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns ol{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .reflist-columns li{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-alpha{list-style-type:upper-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-upper-roman{list-style-type:upper-roman}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-alpha{list-style-type:lower-alpha}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-greek{list-style-type:lower-greek}.mw-parser-output .reflist-lower-roman{list-style-type:lower-roman}</style><div class=\"reflist\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-RFB2004Spiders-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-RFB2004Spiders_1-0\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r95173179\">.mw-parser-output cite.citation{font-style:inherit;word-wrap:break-word}.mw-parser-output .citation q{quotes:\"\\\"\"\"\\\"\"\"'\"\"'\"}.mw-parser-output .citation:target{background-color:rgba(0,127,255,0.133)}.mw-parser-output .id-lock-free.id-lock-free a{background:url(\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/65/Lock-green.svg\")right 0.1em center/9px no-repeat}.mw-parser-outpu